title: "Now"
description: "What I'm doing now."
date: 2026-11-01
image: /img/og/now.jpeg
---

<h1>What I'm doing now</h1>

<p class="now-updated">Last updated: <time datetime="{{ date | htmlDateString }}">{{ date | readableDate }}</time></p>

<p>This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">now page</a>, a snapshot of what I'm focused on at the moment. Update the date in the frontmatter whenever you change it.</p>

<h2>Current focus</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Planting a small vegetable garden</li>
    <li>Learning to bake sourdough</li>
    <li>Writing here at least once a week</li>
</ul>

<p>You can also check my latest projects <a href="/projects/">on this page</a>.</p>

<h2>Currently reading</h2>
<ul>
    {%- for book in books -%}
        {% if book.status === "reading" %}
            <li>{{ book.title }} <span style="font-size: 80%; font-family: var(--font-family-monospace);">by {{ book.author }}</span></li>
        {% endif %}
    {%- endfor -%}
</ul>

{%- set recentWriting = collections.archiveFeed | head(3) -%}
{%- if recentWriting.length %}
<h2>Latest writings</h2>
<ul class="now-recent-list">
{%- for entry in recentWriting %}
	{% set isNote = entry.inputPath and ("content/raw/" in entry.inputPath) %}
	<li class="now-recent-item">
		<a href="{{ entry.url }}">{% if entry.data.title %}{{ entry.data.title }}{% else %}<code>{{ entry.url }}</code>{% endif %}</a>
		<ul class="post-metadata home-feed-metadata">
			<li class="now-recent-kind">
				{% if isNote %}
				<span class="entry-kind entry-kind-note" title="note" aria-label="note"></span>
				{% else %}
				<span class="entry-kind entry-kind-blog" title="blog" aria-label="blog"></span>
				{% endif %}
				<time datetime="{{ entry.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ entry.date | readableDatetime }}</time>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
<p>You can find <a href="/archive/">more in the archive</a>.</p>
{%- endif %}
